-- === Natural try/catch ===
try to
    raise "err1"
catch the error then
    display "1: {error}".

attempt to
    raise "err2"
but if it fails then
    display "2: {error}".

try
    raise "err3"
but if it errors
    display "3: {error}".

try
    raise "err4"
if it fails then
    display "4: {error}".

-- === Possessive form ===
x is 42
display x's type
display "hello"'s length

my-list is [10, 20, 30]
display my-list's length

-- === Articles before builtins ===
display the absolute value of -7
display the square root of 25
display the floor of 3.7
display the type of "hello"
display the length of "testing"

-- === Conversion variations ===
display the conversion of "3.14" to a number
display the conversion of 100 to a string
display the conversion of "42" as a number
display the conversion of 99 as a string
display convert "2.5" to number
display convert 7 as a string

-- === List slicing ===
items is [10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60]
display items between 1 and 3 of items
display items between 0 and 2 in items

-- With ordinals
display items between the 2nd and 5th index of items

display "All natural language forms work"
